msgid "All the tables extending these tables above"
msgstr "위 테이블들을 확장하는 모든 테이블"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:85
msgid ""
"Subscriptions are only supported for ``incident``, ``problem``, and "
"``change_request`` record types."
msgstr "구독은 ``incident``, ``problem``, ``change_request`` 레코드 유형에 대해서만 지원됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:88
msgid "Mattermost configuration"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 구성"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:90
msgid "A Mattermost system admin must perform the following steps in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자가 OKR.BEST에서 다음 단계를 수행해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:92
msgid "Install the ServiceNow integration from the in-product App Marketplace:"
msgstr "제품 내 앱 마켓플레이스에서 ServiceNow 통합을 설치합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:96
msgid ""
"We recommend making a copy of your webhook and encryption secret, as it "
"will only be visible to you once."
msgstr "웹훅과 암호화 시크릿은 한 번만 표시되므로 사본을 만들어 둘 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:98
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, from the Product menu |product-list|, select **App "
"Marketplace**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제품 메뉴 |product-list|\\ 에서 **앱 마켓플레이스**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr "제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:99
msgid "Search for or scroll to ServiceNow, and select **Install**."
msgstr "ServiceNow를 검색하거나 스크롤하여 찾은 뒤 **설치**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:100
msgid "Once installed, select **Configure**. You're taken to the System Console."
msgstr "설치되면 **구성**\\ 을 선택합니다. 관리자 도구로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:101
msgid ""
"On the ServiceNow configuration page, enable and configure ServiceNow "
"interoperability as follows, and then select **Save**:"
msgstr "ServiceNow 구성 페이지에서 다음과 같이 ServiceNow 상호 운용성을 활성화하고 구성한 다음 **저장**\\ 을 선택합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:103
msgid ""
"**ServiceNow Server Base URL**: Enter the base URL of your ServiceNow "
"instance."
msgstr "**ServiceNow Server Base URL**: ServiceNow 인스턴스의 기본 URL을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:104
msgid ""
"**ServiceNow Webhook Secret**: Regenerate the webhook secret for "
"ServiceNow. Regenerating this key will stop the subscription "
"notifications. See the documentation on `creating an OAuth app in "
"ServiceNow <#create-an-oauth-app-in-servicenow>`__ for details on "
"updating the secret in the ServiceNow instance and start receiving "
"notifications again."
msgstr "**ServiceNow Webhook Secret**: ServiceNow용 웹훅 시크릿을 재생성합니다. 이 키를 재생성하면 구독 알림이 중지됩니다. ServiceNow 인스턴스에서 시크릿을 업데이트하고 알림을 다시 받기 시작하는 방법에 대한 자세한 내용은 `ServiceNow에서 OAuth 앱 만들기 <#create-an-oauth-app-in-servicenow>`__ 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:105
msgid ""
"**ServiceNow OAuth Client ID**: The clientID of your registered OAuth app"
" in ServiceNow."
msgstr "**ServiceNow OAuth Client ID**: ServiceNow에 등록된 OAuth 앱의 clientID입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:106
msgid ""
"**ServiceNow OAuth Client Secret**: The client secret of your registered "
"OAuth app in ServiceNow."
msgstr "**ServiceNow OAuth Client Secret**: ServiceNow에 등록된 OAuth 앱의 클라이언트 시크릿입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Encryption Secret**: Select **Regenerate** to generate a new encryption"
" secret. This encryption secret is used to encrypt and decrypt the OAuth "
"token. Regenerating this secret will require all users to reconnect their"
" ServiceNow accounts."
msgstr "**Encryption Secret**: 새 암호화 시크릿을 생성하려면 **Regenerate**\\ 를 선택합니다. 이 암호화 시크릿은 OAuth 토큰을 암호화하고 복호화하는 데 사용됩니다. 이 시크릿을 재생성하면 모든 사용자가 ServiceNow 계정을 다시 연결해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Download ServiceNow Update Set**: Download the update set XML file to "
"upload to ServiceNow."
msgstr "**Download ServiceNow Update Set**: ServiceNow에 업로드할 업데이트 세트 XML 파일을 다운로드합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:111
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "활성화"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:113
msgid ""
"Notify your teams that they can `connect their ServiceNow accounts to "
"Mattermost <#connect-a-servicenow-account-to-mattermost>`__."
msgstr "팀에 `ServiceNow 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결 <#connect-a-servicenow-account-to-mattermost>`__\\ 할 수 있음을 알리세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:116
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:118
msgid ""
"We recommend updating this integration as new versions are released. "
"Generally, updates are seamless and don't interrupt the user experience "
"in Mattermost. Visit the `Releases page <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-servicenow/releases>`__ for the latest release, "
"available releases, and compatibility considerations."
msgstr "새 버전이 출시될 때 이 통합을 업데이트할 것을 권장합니다. 일반적으로 업데이트는 매끄럽게 이루어지며 OKR.BEST의 사용자 경험을 방해하지 않습니다. 최신 릴리스, 사용 가능한 릴리스, 호환성 고려 사항은 `릴리스 페이지 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-servicenow/releases>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:121
msgid "Use"
msgstr "사용"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:123
msgid ""
"Users who want to use ServiceNow interconnectivity must connect a "
"ServiceNow account to Mattermost."
msgstr "ServiceNow 상호 연결을 사용하려는 사용자는 ServiceNow 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:125
msgid ""
"Once connected, you'll receive direct messages from the ServiceNow bot in"
" Mattermost for ServiceNow activity."
msgstr "연결되면 ServiceNow 활동에 대해 OKR.BEST에서 ServiceNow 봇으로부터 개인 메시지를 받게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:128
msgid "Connect a ServiceNow account to Mattermost"
msgstr "ServiceNow 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:130
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, run the ``/servicenow connect`` slash command in any "
"Mattermost channel to link your Mattermost account with your ServiceNow "
"account. Follow the link into your ServiceNow instance, and select "
"**Allow**. You can disconnect your accounts by running the ``/servicenow "
"disconnect`` slash command. Alternatively, select the **ServiceNow** icon"
" in the apps bar on the right to connect your ServiceNow account."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 아무 OKR.BEST 채널에서 ``/servicenow connect`` 슬래시 명령어를 실행하여 OKR.BEST 계정을 ServiceNow 계정과 연결합니다. ServiceNow 인스턴스로 연결되는 링크를 따라가 **Allow**\\ 를 선택합니다. ``/servicenow disconnect`` 슬래시 명령어를 실행하여 계정 연결을 해제할 수 있습니다. 또는 오른쪽 앱 바에서 **ServiceNow** 아이콘을 선택하여 ServiceNow 계정을 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:132
msgid ""
"Once connected, run the ``/servicenow help`` slash command to see what "
"you can do."
msgstr "연결되면 ``/servicenow help`` 슬래시 명령어를 실행하여 할 수 있는 작업을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:134
msgid ""
"Available slash commands include ``/servicenow subscriptions`` to manage "
"notification subscriptions, ``/servicenow share`` to search and share "
"ServiceNow records in a channel, and ``/servicenow incident create`` to "
"create a new incident directly from Mattermost."
msgstr "사용 가능한 슬래시 명령어로는 알림 구독을 관리하는 ``/servicenow subscriptions``, 채널에서 ServiceNow 레코드를 검색하고 공유하는 ``/servicenow share``, OKR.BEST에서 직접 새 인시던트를 생성하는 ``/servicenow incident create`` 등이 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:137
msgid "Customize"
msgstr "사용자 정의"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:139
msgid "This integration contains both a server and web app portion."
msgstr "이 통합은 서버와 웹 앱 부분을 모두 포함합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:141
msgid ""
"ServiceNow itself provides developer instances to anyone who wishes to "
"develop on ServiceNow. Developers can get a ServiceNow developer instance"
" by logging in to their ServiceNow developer account, and selecting "
"**Request Instance** in the top right corner. Once the instance is "
"created, open the menu from the top right corner, go to **Manage Instance"
" Password**, and log in to the developer instance in a new tab."
msgstr "ServiceNow는 ServiceNow에서 개발하려는 누구에게나 개발자 인스턴스를 제공합니다. 개발자는 ServiceNow 개발자 계정으로 로그인하고 오른쪽 상단에서 **Request Instance**\\ 를 선택하여 ServiceNow 개발자 인스턴스를 받을 수 있습니다. 인스턴스가 생성되면 오른쪽 상단에서 메뉴를 열고 **Manage Instance Password**\\ 로 이동한 다음, 새 탭에서 개발자 인스턴스에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:143
msgid ""
"See the `Development <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"servicenow/blob/master/docs/developer_docs.md#development>`_ section of "
"the Mattermost ServiceNow Plugin GitHub repository for details on "
"customizing this integration."
msgstr "이 통합을 사용자 정의하는 방법에 대한 자세한 내용은 Mattermost ServiceNow Plugin GitHub 리포지토리의 `Development <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-servicenow/blob/master/docs/developer_docs.md#development>`_ 섹션을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:145
msgid ""
"Visit the `Mattermost Developer Workflow "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-workflow/>`__"
" and `Mattermost Developer environment setup "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-setup/>`_ for"
" information about developing, customizing, and extending Mattermost "
"functionality."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 기능을 개발, 사용자 정의, 확장하는 방법에 대한 정보는 `Mattermost Developer Workflow <https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-workflow/>`__\\ 와 `Mattermost Developer environment setup <https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-setup/>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:148
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "도움말 보기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:150
msgid ""
"Mattermost customers can open a `Mattermost support case "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. To report a "
"bug, please open a GitHub issue against the `Mattermost ServiceNow plugin"
" repository <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"servicenow>`_."
msgstr "Mattermost 고객은 `Mattermost 지원 케이스 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 를 열 수 있습니다. 버그를 신고하려면 `Mattermost ServiceNow 플러그인 리포지토리 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-servicenow>`_\\ 에 GitHub 이슈를 열어 주세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:152
msgid ""
"For questions, feedback, and assistance, join our public `Integrations "
"and Apps channel "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_ on the "
"`Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_ for "
"assistance."
msgstr "질문, 피드백, 도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 의 공개 `Integrations and Apps channel <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_\\ 에 참여하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:154
msgid ""
"Mattermost Team Edition and Free customers can visit the Mattermost "
"`peer-to-peer troubleshooting forum <https://forum.mattermost.com/c"
"/trouble-shoot/16>`_ to access the global Mattermost Community for "
"assistance."
msgstr "Mattermost Team Edition 및 Free 고객은 Mattermost `P2P 문제 해결 포럼 <https://forum.mattermost.com/c/trouble-shoot/16>`_\\ 을 방문하여 글로벌 Mattermost 커뮤니티의 도움을 받을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/servicenow.rst:158
msgid ""
"Watch `this on-demand webinar on incident response with Mattermost and "
"ServiceNow <https://mattermost.com/video/streamline-incident-response-"
"with-mattermost-and-servicenow/>`_ to learn how to streamline incident "
"response."
msgstr "인시던트 대응을 간소화하는 방법을 알아보려면 `Mattermost와 ServiceNow를 사용한 인시던트 대응에 대한 이 온디맨드 웨비나 <https://mattermost.com/video/streamline-incident-response-with-mattermost-and-servicenow/>`_\\ 를 시청하세요."

